  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Murdertalon Raiders",
    "summary": "**HERETIC ASTARTES INFANTRY** can reroll 1s to hit when attacking enemies that are **[Battle-shocked](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock)** or **below half strength**. An enemy in either state takes a −1 [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) penalty on attacks against that infantry. This detachment has **NIGHTMARE**, which prevents taking a second detachment with that keyword.",
